' The selected one acts himself (v0.9.1 `LocationScene` works on
' `SelectedCharacter`): a companion walks up to somebody who wanders, waits
' out his thirty seconds for the others and speaks (only TALK and EXIT: no
' hiring when it is not the player's own character asking); a companion
' strikes a dog alone; a camper walks where the click was, to a pile, and his
' own inventory opens, one page, him. The start is group_part.script's.
mapclick 75,303          ' walk into New Sandez
clickon 248              ' walk up to a mercenary, wherever he has wandered, and ask
hire                     ' he takes the meat
trade                    ' walk over to the trader, who waits for you
trade
uiclick 204,211          ' the canteen out of the pack, keeping the knife
uiclick 318,128          ' for a meat off the trader's table
deal                     ' a deal closes the table by itself
esc                      ' the trader's scene stays after a deal (OnButtonAccept); leave it
clickon 63               ' and a second mercenary, paid with that meat
hire
clickfriend 1            ' select him: single mode, he is the one who walks
wait 5
mapclick 160,120         ' away from the trader, alone
wait 150
clickon 69               ' he walks up to another mercenary and follows him while he wanders
wait 2400                ' the others are not coming: the wait runs its thirty seconds, then he speaks
talkline 0               ' the greeting pages
wait 5
talkline 0
wait 5
snap companion_talks     ' "What's up?" and "End conversation." — nothing else
talkline 2               ' end it
wait 5
group                    ' the group again (SelectGroup): the leader is selected
esc                      ' back out onto the world map, the group with you
mapclick 61,355          ' sets out for Bearwoods
mapclick 61,355          ' in, all of you at the entry
mapclick 300,120         ' walk in among the dogs
wait 150
clickfriend 1            ' him again
wait 5
fight
clickon 142              ' the dog: he walks up and strikes alone (Attack joins the group only for the player's character)
wait 30
fight                    ' speak mode
wait 5
menu 320,150
menuline 4               ' STAY THERE: Bearwoods is ours, and he is still selected — now a camper
wait 10
mapclick 224,300         ' the camper walks to the pile, and his inventory opens there
wait 150
snap camper_inventory    ' one page, numbered 1: his group is himself
uiclick 266,118          ' he picks up the sweater
wait 5
esc                      ' back into his camp, with it
wait 5
save                     ' the cut, here too
clickon 248              ' already selected: OnMenuInventory on him
wait 5
uiclick 132,211          ' the sweater down where he stands
wait 5
esc
wait 5
mapclick 260,250         ' and he walks off; the leader stays
wait 100
save
